        heading: "After someone fills it in",
        text: "Open the form and look under Submissions to see who filled it in. Each person also lands in Contacts. A campaign on the form only sends once your Email sending setup is finished. Turn off stops the form taking new submissions, and you can press Turn on at any time. To put a form on your own website, link to the share link, or point a plain HTML form at the address shown on the form, which also shows the input names to use. New people from a form count toward your Customer Acquisition pillar, and people credited to an affiliate count toward your Referral Process pillar.",
