        text: "Sales Activities is your log of every sales touch: calls, follow-ups, emails, DMs, meetings, demos and proposals. It adds them up into tiles, shows this week against your goals, and gives you a report. Your log feeds your scores, so keeping it honest shows you where your sales work really stands. Scripts & Templates gives you ready-to-use words so that work gets done faster.",
