        heading: "What moves your scores",
        text: "What counts is how many Foundational sections have text in them. For the Business Plan that is the five Foundational sections, and for the Marketing and Sales Plans it is the four. Optional sections do not change it, and neither does marking a section complete. Goal statuses do not change your 12 dimensions, and neither do your weekly targets. A Business Plan goal you assign to a business segment counts toward that segment's own score. Foundational sections are the practical minimum for a useful plan. Optional sections add depth. Nothing stops you moving around, but printing needs every section, Optional ones too.",
