        text: "Customer Acquisition, Sales Journey, Onboarding, Support / Customer Service, Communication, Fulfillment, Internal Process & Culture, and Referral Process. The Suite scores each one from 0 to 100, and nobody can set a pillar score by hand. Each pillar is scored from the Brain and Profit answers, the Quick Pulse check-ins, activity in the Suite and that pillar's Go deeper answers. The average of the eight is one part of the Operations dimension. The Operations score at the top of the page is that dimension. It also includes the Profit answers, the Brain answers and the Quick Pulse check-in.",
