        text: "Choose Asked to stop as soon as someone asks, so the Suite never emails them either. It moves their card to the stop stage and marks them Do Not Contact in Contacts, even if they had no card. They are unsubscribed, tagged, and taken out of your email campaigns. Bounced moves the card to the same stage, but it does not mark the person Do Not Contact.",
